{
  "schema": "lgpe-gamedata-v1",
  "format": "LGPE-message",
  "lines": [
    {
      "index": 0,
      "id": "msg_opening_doctor_01",
      "hash": "c326c6574dd89d45",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "你好！\\n很高兴见到你！\\c\\n欢迎来到精灵宝可梦的世界！\\c\\n我叫大木，\\n大家都亲切地称我为\\r\\n宝可梦博士。"
    },
    {
      "index": 1,
      "id": "msg_ookido_01_p02_1_opening_00",
      "hash": "18c364aa4db1cb39",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "[~ 1]"
    },
    {
      "index": 2,
      "id": "msg_opening_doctor_02",
      "hash": "c326c3574dd8982c",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "在这个世界里，\\n到处都生活着一种叫做\\r\\n精灵宝可梦的生物！"
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "id": "msg_opening_doctor_03",
      "hash": "c326c4574dd899df",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "有些人会亲切地照顾它们，"
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "id": "msg_opening_doctor_12",
      "hash": "c32a4d574ddbb881",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "而有些人会指挥它们进行对战……"
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "id": "msg_opening_doctor_13",
      "hash": "c32a4c574ddbb6ce",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "至于我……"
    },
    {
      "index": 6,
      "id": "msg_opening_doctor_14",
      "hash": "c32a4f574ddbbbe7",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "作为一名博士，\\n我正在研究它们。"
    },
    {
      "index": 7,
      "id": "msg_opening_doctor_04",
      "hash": "c326c1574dd894c6",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "那么，先来说说你自己吧！"
    },
    {
      "index": 8,
      "id": "msg_opening_doctor_05",
      "hash": "c326c2574dd89679",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "你长什么样子？"
    },
    {
      "index": 9,
      "id": "msg_opening_doctor_06",
      "hash": "c326bf574dd89160",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "能把名字也告诉我吗？\\c"
    },
    {
      "index": 10,
      "id": "msg_ookido_01_p04_2_opening_00",
      "hash": "128f8ef93299e040",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "[~ 10]"
    },
    {
      "index": 11,
      "id": "msg_opening_doctor_07",
      "hash": "c326c0574dd89313",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "哦……\\n你叫[VAR TRNAME(0000)]啊！"
    },
    {
      "index": 12,
      "id": "msg_opening_doctor_08",
      "hash": "c326cd574dd8a92a",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "这个男孩子\\n既是你的邻居朋友，\\r\\n也是你的对手。\\c\\n他的名字叫什么呢？"
    },
    {
      "index": 13,
      "id": "msg_ookido_01_p06_1_opening_00",
      "hash": "e742d0562f688675",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "你的对手的名字是……？\\c"
    },
    {
      "index": 14,
      "id": "msg_opening_doctor_09",
      "hash": "c326ce574dd8aadd",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "叫做[VAR TRNAME(0001)]，可以吗？"
    },
    {
      "index": 15,
      "id": "msg_opening_doctor_10",
      "hash": "c32a4b574ddbb51b",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "哦，原来他叫[VAR TRNAME(0001)]啊！"
    },
    {
      "index": 16,
      "id": "msg_opening_doctor_11",
      "hash": "c32a4a574ddbb368",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "[VAR TRNAME(0000)]！"
    },
    {
      "index": 17,
      "id": "msg_opening_doctor_15",
      "hash": "c32a4e574ddbba34",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "接下来，你的故事就要开始了！"
    },
    {
      "index": 18,
      "id": "msg_opening_doctor_16",
      "hash": "c32a51574ddbbf4d",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "充满梦想与冒险的\\n精灵宝可梦世界！"
    },
    {
      "index": 19,
      "id": "msg_opening_doctor_17",
      "hash": "c32a50574ddbbd9a",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "Let's go!"
    },
    {
      "index": 20,
      "id": "msg_opening_doctor_yes",
      "hash": "ec11fd5aad6f974d",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "是"
    },
    {
      "index": 21,
      "id": "msg_opening_doctor_no",
      "hash": "c3ebf8574e8039f1",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "否"
    },
    {
